**Methodology** - Infrastructure engagement

1) Reconnaisance/Enumeration - What do we know and what do we need to know?
2) Vulnerability Analysis - Analyse results of enumeration and connect weaknesses discovered.
3) Initial Access - Choose and execute an attack - Initial foothold in the target. 
4) Privilege escalation - Enumerate from the inside and find a way up. 
5) Reporting - Document findings and attack chain to communicate to shareholders. Report on risk level and recommend actions to remediate issues. 
